digraph ros_graph {
  rankdir=LR; splines=true; nodesep=0.3; ranksep=1.2;
  node [fontname="Helvetica", fontsize=11]; edge [color="#8a8984", arrowsize=0.6];
  labelloc=t; fontname="Helvetica"; fontsize=16;
  label="Graphe ROS 2 / ROS 2 graph — complet / full: tous les topics / every topic\nEllipses = nœuds / nodes · rectangles = topics (type) · hexagones = actions (tirets / dashed)\nMasqués / hidden: /rosout, /parameter_events, /clock (tous les nœuds / every node), transform_listener_impl_*, rosbag2_recorder (banc de test / test harness)";
